  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Support and Psychological Rehabilitation for Soldiers of the Anti-Terrorist Operation in Donbass and their Families</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Support and psychological rehabilitation of anti-terrorist operation soldiers in Donbass</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The goal of the project is to enhance the conditions and quality of psychological rehabilitation for veterans in Donbass and their families by acquiring new beds and mattresses at the rehabilitation facility in Slavyanohorsk. The project only addresses civilian care to displaced families of discharged soldiers within the framework of public social security of Ukraine.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Mikrogrant je zameran&#xfd; na zlep&#x161;enie vybavenia pre lok&#xe1;lne psychologick&#xe9; rehabilita&#x10d;n&#xe9; centrum pre ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch vojensk&#xfd;ch veter&#xe1;nov z oper&#xe1;ci&#xed; na Donbase, a to zak&#xfa;pen&#xed;m 24 kusov postel&#xed; a matracov, &#x10d;&#xed;m sa zabezpe&#x10d;&#xed; jeho sprev&#xe1;dzkovanie.</narrative>
  </description>
